          %title
          %div{:style => "float:right;margin:0px 0px 0px 30px;"}
            %img{:alt => "Hisham Sati", :src => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/content/nyuad/en/home/academics/divisions/science/faculty/hisham-sati/jcr:content/bio-info/image.adaptive.m1510293714140/290.jpg"}/
          %p
            Hisham Sati (
            %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/academics/divisions/science/faculty/hisham-ahmad-sati.html"}> faculty page
            ) is working on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/non-perturbative+effects"} non-perturbative
            phenomena in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
            using tools of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology"} cohomology
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+category+theory"} higher category theory
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Duff"} Michael Duff
          %p
            Hisham Sati is an associate professor of
            %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/academics/divisions/science/academic-programs/math.html"} mathematics at NYU Abu Dhabi
            and lead-PI of the
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Center+for+Quantum+and+Topological+Systems"} Center for Quantum and Topological Systems
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "https://nyuad.nyu.edu/en/academics/divisions/science/faculty/hisham-sati.html"} webpage
          %p
            From his
            = succeed ":" do
              %a{:href => "https://web.archive.org/web/20170811155442/http://www.mathematics.pitt.edu/person/hisham-sati"} cached Pitt faculty page
          %blockquote
            %p
              My research is interdisciplinary and lies in the intersection of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+geometry"} differential geometry
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+topology"} algebraic topology
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematical+physics"} mathematical/theoretical physics
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theory"} quantum (topological) field theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientation+in+generalized+cohomology"} orientations
              with respect to
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+cohomology+theories"} generalized cohomology theories
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+geometry"} higher geometric
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topology"} topological
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} categorical
              notions of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundles"} bundles
          %h2#selected_talks Selected talks
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %em> Geometric perspectives on topological action functionals
                , talk at
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "http://qcpages.qc.cuny.edu/~swilson/cunyworkshop14.html"} The CUNY Workshop on differential cohomology
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://videostreaming.gc.cuny.edu/videos/video/1802/"} video recording
            %li
              %p
                %em> M-theory and cohomotopy
                , talk at
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-Theory+and+Mathematics"} M-Theory and Mathematics
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/Sati_MTheoryCohomotopy_2020.pdf"} pdf slides
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (on
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hypothesis+H"} Hypothesis H
                  %em )
          %h2#selected_publications Selected publications
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Hisham Sati,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Geometric+and+topological+structures+related+to+M-branes"} Geometric and topological structures related to M-branes
              %p
                part I, in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Superstrings, Geometry, Topology, and
                    = succeed "-algebras" do
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %msup
                              %mi C
                              %mo *
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^{\ast}
                %strong 81
                (2010) 181-236 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://arXiv.org/abs/1001.5020"}> arXiv:1001.5020
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/books/pspum/081"} ams:pspum/081
              %p
                part
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    II: Twisted
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi String
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} String
                    and
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi String
                            %mi c
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} String^c
                    structures
                = succeed ");" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1007.5419"} arXiv:1007.5419
              %p
                part
                = succeed "," do
                  %em III: Twisted higher structures
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1008.1755"} arXiv:1008.1755
          %p
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohomology"} cohomology
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+cohomology"} twisted cohomology
            structures in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+smooth+cohomology+in+string+theory"} twisted smooth cohomology in string theory
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} modular equivariant elliptic cohomology
            in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+string+theory"} type II string theory
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"} F-theory
          %ul
            %li#SatiKriz04
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"}> Igor Kriz
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %em M-theory, type IIA superstrings, and elliptic cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://projecteuclid.org/euclid.atmp/1091543172"} euclid:atmp/1091543172
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0404013"} arXiv:hep-th/0404013
            %li#KrizSati04b
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"}> Igor Kriz
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Type IIB String Theory, S-Duality, and Generalized Cohomology
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0410293"} arXiv:hep-th/0410293
            %li#KrizSati05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Kriz"}> Igor Kriz
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Type II string theory and modularity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0501060"} arXiv:hep-th/0501060
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Diaconescu-Moore-Witten+anomaly"} Diaconescu-Moore-Witten anomaly
            interpreted in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integral+Morava+K-theory"} integral Morava K-theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Craig+Westerland"} Craig Westerland
                %em Twisted Morava K-theory and E-theory
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1109.3867"}> arXiv:1109.3867
                )
              %p
                (this is followed up on in remark 5.4.12 in
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Hopkins"} Hopkins
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"} Lurie
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ambidexterity+in+K%28n%29-Local+Stable+Homotopy+Theory"} Ambidexterity in K(n)-Local Stable Homotopy Theory
                )
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F4"} F4
            and
